      "title": "A Yellowstone Driver Tried to Pass a Bison. The Bull Attacked.",
      "content_html": "<figure><img alt=\"A Yellowstone Driver Tried to Pass a Bison. The Bull Attacked.\" src=\"https://cdn.outsideonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-24-at-5.21.45-PM.png?width=1200\" /></figure>\n<p>A bison popped an SUV tire in Yellowstone's Hayden Valley after the vehicle got too close.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com/outdoor-adventure/exploration-survival/yellowstone-bison-pops-car-tire-video/\">A Yellowstone Driver Tried to Pass a Bison. The Bull Attacked.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.outsideonline.com\">Outside Online</a>.</p>",
